from an airline forum:

xxx: Think about flight safety! At the Vladikavkaz airport they let people onto the plane with Ossetian pies, which at check-in are not counted as an extra piece of hand luggage! My fur coat stank of those pies!!! Why do you let pie-carriers onto the plane?

yyy: Because of YOUR fur coat all the pies are in some kind of fur! Why do they let people in fur coats into the cabin?
